{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"// RESULTS — example.com\n        \n          72SCORE\n          14ISSUES\n          3CRITICAL\n        \n        \n        \n          \n            CRITICAL\n            Images missing alt text (7 instances)\n          \n          \n            SERIOUS\n            Color contrast ratio fails 4.5:1\n          \n        \n        \n        \n          \n            + 12 more issues found\n            Sign up free to view all, export report & fix with AI\n          \n          UNLOCK →\n        \n        \n        \n          MODERATE████████████\n          MINOR███████████\n        \n      \n    \n    \n      C — Inline CTA woven into results\n      First 2 issues shown in full. Then an inline card: \"+12 more issues — sign up to unlock.\" Remaining issues blurred below. Creates urgency without a modal.\n      \n        Highest conversion pressure\n        Results teasing drives action\n        Slightly misleading if user expects \"full results\"\n        Could feel manipulative — use carefully","choice":"inline-cta","id":null,"timestamp":1774386826185}
