{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"✓ Scan complete — sign up free to save & rescan\n          CREATE ACCOUNT →\n        \n        \n        // RESULTS — example.com\n        \n          72SCORE\n          14ISSUES\n          3CRITICAL\n        \n        \n          \n            CRITICAL\n            Images missing alt text (7 instances)\n          \n          \n            SERIOUS\n            Color contrast ratio fails 4.5:1\n          \n        \n      \n    \n    \n      B — Banner below nav\n      A slim banner appears at the top of the results area when the scan completes. Left-border accent, inline CTA. Scrolls away as the user reads results.\n      \n        Appears at natural reading start point\n        Scrolls out of view — low ongoing pressure\n        Clean, inline with results flow","choice":"top-banner","id":null,"timestamp":1774386846441}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"// SCAN COMPLETE — example.com\n        \n          72SCORE\n          14ISSUES\n          3CRITICAL\n        \n        \n        \n          \n            CRITICAL\n            Images missing alt text (7 instances)\n          \n          \n            SERIOUS\n            Color contrast ratio fails 4.5:1 minimum\n          \n        \n        ...full results visible above...\n      \n      \n      \n        \n          Save results & scan again\n          FREE ACCOUNT · NO CREDIT CARD\n        \n        \n          SIGN UP →\n          Log in\n        \n      \n    \n    \n      A — Sticky bottom bar\n      A slim green-tinted bar anchored to the bottom of the viewport. Results stay fully readable. Persistent but non-intrusive. Disappears on sign-up.\n      \n        Least disruptive to result reading\n        Always visible — no scrolling needed\n        Fits the editorial aesthetic well","choice":"sticky-bar","id":null,"timestamp":1774386855975}
